    "detailed_description": "Embark on an adventure in a casual card game, where you strategically summon Moni Mons across three rows. Your mission: race against your opponent to ensure seven of your Moni Mons reach the end before theirs do.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCraft your own deck, unlocking new cards as you challenge and conquer the most formidable opponents in the Moni Mon card scene.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDiscover three distinct types of cards at your disposal: Summon cards, enabling the summoning of Moni Mons; Effect cards, capable of obstructing your opponent's Mons while aiding your own; and Power cards, wielding immense strength to tilt the battle decisively in your favor.",
    "about_the_game": "Embark on an adventure in a casual card game, where you strategically summon Moni Mons across three rows. Your mission: race against your opponent to ensure seven of your Moni Mons reach the end before theirs do.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCraft your own deck, unlocking new cards as you challenge and conquer the most formidable opponents in the Moni Mon card scene.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDiscover three distinct types of cards at your disposal: Summon cards, enabling the summoning of Moni Mons; Effect cards, capable of obstructing your opponent's Mons while aiding your own; and Power cards, wielding immense strength to tilt the battle decisively in your favor.",
    "short_description": "Summon mighty Moni Mons to challenge your opponent's forces. Employ strategic Effect cards to shift the tide of battle in your favor. Harness the immense power of Power cards to decisively sway the outcome of the conflict.",
